  m_Text: '1  Point the controller ray at a button or hotspot.

    2  Press the
    controller trigger to select.

    3  Select a hotspot to move between 360 locations.

    4 
    Open MAP to check your current position.

    5  Open DESTINATIONS to start route
    guidance.

    6  Inside Room 301, point at the floor to teleport.'
